{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《KoalaSpeak》是一款以拼字遊戲學習英文單字的 App，適合想輕鬆擴充詞彙的初學者至進階學習者；目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-132.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>拼字遊戲結合詞彙學習</h2>\n<p>提供 Letter Connect、Crossword 與 Word Search 玩法，收錄 6,191 個英文單字、20 段旅程及近 8,000 個關卡，程度由 A1 至 C2。點按單字可查看意思、例句與翻譯並聽發音，My Words 會記錄已找到的詞彙；每日謎題、連續記錄和自訂目標有助維持學習節奏，並支援離線遊玩、無需帳號及最多 4 個個人檔案。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-131-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-132-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-133-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-134-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-135-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-136-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：KoalaSpeak: Vocab Wonders</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/koalaspeak-vocab-wonders/id6820783189?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:42.348028+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T00:53:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:58:44.596291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:59:01.200006+00:00","content_hash":"b67427a28cf229ca7aa7d85e76034971e4a6bfe18f533220dd8ae9f935394504","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}